Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all the\Nothers left is to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Start raising our flag as we journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!\NLet's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams,\Nwhile keeping the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't keep heading for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What we'll have to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories we'll say in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Mosshead doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to bring the\Nwhole damn tower down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wrote this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I might as well follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami and Usopp are probably\Non their way to Robin already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is the key they need,\NI can't keep them waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you move any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, the bridge of hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It took long enough, and I admit\Nit was scary for a while there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but I finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I step through those gates,\NI'll be the government's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will be a hero to the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge leading to the\Ngate is rising as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's calling out to its hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A path into the horizon as\Nradiant as my shining future!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, for you it must look like\Na path straight to hell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're thinking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of chasing you around damn it\Nfor the last time you can't escape so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest you obstinate cow I'm\Nthe hero of the entire world and that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Means I'm different than\Nyou, better than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I finally gotten that\Nthrough your thick skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do I need to keep\Ngrinding it in for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, everyone, I still believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point if I\Ndon't make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes until we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All hands are ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships confirm positions\Nand prepare for attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to ruin this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, straw-head!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, it's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got enough jerks to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you're still playing\Ntough after all we've been through?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're bros now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucci, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You giving you a hard time or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I brought you two keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess Robin's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I lend you a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this guy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go after Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get to the Gates of Justice\Nthrough that door behind the pigeon guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin left a while back so\Nwe're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can super count on me brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, just so we're straight here,\Ndespite my appearance, I prefer meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just so we're straight\Nhere, I really don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, enough small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't make it in time,\Nthis is all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style. Nigiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you supposed to get stronger when\Nyou wear that bandana on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tower climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tower climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Triple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given yourself a blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body, edgewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no blind spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,on a square.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can't move, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should remind you of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,giraffes have four legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight me or just sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the slashes go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They deflect off the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And then finally, they come raining down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A nose pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite resilient for a\Nhuman, but I'm a giraffe boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your superhero name, Giraffe Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:09:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just giraffe, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's giraffe fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the giraffe. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to yourself, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares if you're\Ngiraffe boy or whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a swordsman, then\Nlet your blade speak for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can get under my\Nskin, you're just wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting under your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cut straight through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you use your iron body,\NI'll cut through that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body isn't the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't cut me at all, it doesn't\Nmatter if my body's iron or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to take a different approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Two gorilla. Now. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style, a test of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,this time is it sounds fun to me nose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly a fearsome attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You never thought you might lose, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even imagine that\NI might be stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I could say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Paper art.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten-thirty king!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kum-kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't seen the true,\Nwild strength of a giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop talking and show me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe, for this is the power of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing natural about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Extreme nose pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Extract!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's like I said, that neck\Nof yours is your weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep telling yourself that. Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Spinning white blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you worry about your\Nown weak points instead of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,These attacks just keep getting weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I pushed my neck in so far, it\Nmade my arms and legs pop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have messed\Nup, buddy, have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like when you cram dough through a\Nlittle hole and it comes out as noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a pasta machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasta machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you did that on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A long neck is nice, but long\Nlimbs like these are handy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A pro like me can turn even the most\Nunexpected situations into fresh opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold as I unleash a devastating\Nnew long-range technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the same attack you did before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Resort style. Tatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Margellion button!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasta machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can control the reach of all four\Nlimbs, my blades will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you were so distracted\Nby my giraffe powers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.52,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that you forgot I'm a master\Nof the four-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well thus far,\Nbut this battle is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you have the\Npower of a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can attack\Nwith a long neck of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can use a four sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He deflected all four blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,None of those things will give you\Nthe strength it takes to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leopard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he flying at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure he missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he somehow predict\Nwhich way I would dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:16:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you fight I find\Nit hard to believe this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,is the first time you've\Nbeen touched by a blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well it seems you have a little\Nsomething to back up your boast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't underestimate you again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid that one hit is\Nthe best you're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have four swords six powers and the\Nimmeasurable strength of a giraffe on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an equation for victory\Nif I've ever heard one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be over in a flash
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Giraffe Flaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My neck's like a whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whiplash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fierce Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like this? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Still think you can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for a taste of\Nmy four-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fury Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Barely keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is blocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You pirates were sorely\Nmistaken if you thought
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you could defy the world\Ngovernment and survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of justice, a mistake that\Nsevere can only be punished by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The same goes for Nico Robbins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked like a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A god of war with three\Nfaces and six arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mouth just crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to\Npay, you arrogant freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I offend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're tired of hearing me talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just end this now with the\Nsame move that crippled this tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be over in an instant\Nwhen I slice you in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I'll make my attack\Ntwice as powerful as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. It is the end\Nof the line for you, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Aura Nine Sword Style.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Asana
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that demon I saw before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he making that illusion with\Nhis strength of will alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it too late for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you somehow manage to dodge this\Ntempest kick, then nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all top!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He slashed it into mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I commend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffering is welcome on\Nthe path to bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ursula!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The End. From your other\Nboss over at Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see him, I want you\Nto pass on a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you're all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fired, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad it'll be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassination skills don't really\Ncome in handy in other lines of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always get a job at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.88,0:23:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.79,0:23:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Mosshead, did you get a key?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now got it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like you two might have\Noverdone it a bit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tower isn't looking so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.24,0:23:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares anyway that's\Nnot important right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have all of the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.22,0:23:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry and get them to rob it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.48,0:24:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.39,0:24:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to save ourselves and distrust\Nthat throwing the Straw Hats will be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.50,0:24:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we break our legs, the\NFreaky family ain't stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.18,0:24:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, guys, if you're just gonna\Nride, then try to keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I agree, you're never ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with the beam of helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.42,0:24:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiffany, I'm an old woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'm gonna have\Nto refuel to keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.52,0:24:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.34,0:24:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny, he's gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:24:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.61,0:24:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.53,0:25:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.50,0:25:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's your demand today? Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.48,0:25:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.16,0:25:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally the bridge is\Nconnected. I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.96,0:25:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,laughing hey gate guards\Nis everything ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what yes sir everything\Nis in order we're
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.30,0:25:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,awaiting your arrival\Nby the third call that's
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not what I meant the\Ncrew should come out to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.86,0:25:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,salute me their hero\Nchief Spandam has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.70,0:25:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots, they can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Nico Robin, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:25:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That little gate's the real entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.82,0:26:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few more steps and we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you pass through it, you'll be\Ncrossing the border between heaven and hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.42,0:26:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the moment I drag you past it,\Nmy name will be engraved in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey there, witch! Where\Ndo you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.64,0:26:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you may not believe\Nme but I do feel A bit
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.90,0:26:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for you. Too bad I've\Ngot no say in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.90,0:26:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no reason for you\Nto live Your death awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.70,0:26:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.38,0:26:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.86,0:27:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop delaying the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, huh? Damn it! All she\Nwon't budge. What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.78,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me? She's holding on\Nto the bridge with her teeth. She just
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.04,0:27:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't know when to give up does she\Nhow annoying why the hell are you so
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.54,0:27:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,desperate to live don't be so damn\Ngreedy listen to me you're a criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,understand the only way you can make\Nthe world a better place is by dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.14,0:27:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you be such an annoyance\Nall the way to the bitter end?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would\Nbe so afraid of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.64,0:27:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.68,0:27:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.59,0:27:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.26,0:27:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.58,0:28:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow lotus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.60,0:28:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.25,0:28:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I can't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My only concern is getting\Nthrough those doors and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.66,0:28:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll ever get past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to see\Nabout that, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.68,0:28:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some straw!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.70,0:28:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body. Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.54,0:28:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, he didn't even flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That same punch sent that\Nchop-a-pop freak flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.46,0:28:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat Fukuro along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:29:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to break it to you, but my\Npower level is five times his.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.66,0:29:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm impressed you defeated Fukurou.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.74,0:29:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing down any agent of CP9\Nrequires superhuman strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.22,0:29:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this guy's in a\Ncompletely different league.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.26,0:29:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.44,0:29:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.42,0:29:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.10,0:29:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's with all that steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep my body like this for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.06,0:30:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll damn sure stop him, so\Nyou go on ahead and hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.80,0:30:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's waiting right? You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're doing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but keep it up and finish him I
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.64,0:30:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Say you'll never get past me. Didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,die another guy with Devil Fruit powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first, time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten something?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.90,0:30:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the Galley-La building,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the form I was in when I\Ndefeated you with a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.60,0:30:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.84,0:30:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was real hungry that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.96,0:31:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,FINGER PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,KUM KUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.08,0:31:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,IRON BODY!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,SHUT THE KUM KUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.58,0:31:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid woman, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.66,0:31:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.60,0:31:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for you,\Nso just give it up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.62,0:31:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.48,0:31:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all coming to rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.60,0:31:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just super leave it to me.
